I never had any problems with the priest quest:

1) A ring of conflict CAN be useful to keep the nazguls busy. (they are the most
bugging monsters at that level, bar the demon of course)
2) don't move from the stairs: the demon lord will never escape by teleporting.
3) locate him (esp should be gotten at this point), and wake him up (wand...)
4) bash, bash bash. Vorpy is real nice, so neutral priests should behead him
pretty easily.
5) If he summons anything, the RoC would help.
6) If you are in deep problems. climb up the stairs you're just on (though
I guess he would follow you, anyway I always beheaded him in a few strikes, but
I always play neutral priests too! :)  )
7) the bell of opening he carries is usually cursed: ding ding ding!! here
come the hitpoints! I am almost at 3000 hp, wraiths keep coming. This should
be a great score game: Valkiries are easy and their quest produces a lot of gems
but priests are nice too!

